{"about_the_game":"<strong>Risen Kingdom</strong> is a real-time strategy game with building and settlement management mechanics. The game is set in a medieval fantasy world years after a great Kingdom has been overrun by hordes of the undead. Now, the bravest warriors are going on a campaign to claim back the land once lost by their ancestors and bring the Kingdom back to its former glory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your Settlement</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/2e8e70b015996370bd9abba5d75ba0b4.poster.avif?t=1706545574\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/2e8e70b015996370bd9abba5d75ba0b4.webm?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/2e8e70b015996370bd9abba5d75ba0b4.mp4?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build mills and houses to provide your people with food and a place to live.<br></li><li>Obtain natural resources, expand your settlement and develop new technologies.<br></li><li>Build markets and banks to ensure the settlement\u2019s economic stability.<br></li><li>Carefully manage resources, research new tech and lead your settlement to prosperity!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your Settlement</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/1e666f158d3d703d7876dd08f283a857.avif?t=1706545574\" width=600 height=168 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Train and hire warriors to defend your settlement. Each unit has unique skills and upgrades.<br></li><li>Build defensive structures such as stakewalls, lookout posts, cannons and towers.<br></li><li>Make use of strategic possibilities and landscape features.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.poster.avif?t=1706545574\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.webm?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.mp4?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Prepare for the night and try to survive the onslaught of enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.poster.avif?t=1706545574\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.webm?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.mp4?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d66f3511aefd98d703e79c89e80f4d8befba6e05.jpg","localized_name":"Battle-ready","name":"Battle-ready","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1216880/d66f3511aefd98d703e79c89e80f4d8befba6e05.jpg"},{"icon":"aaff6d22241093b6abb47e59f0000d2633f22acb.jpg","localized_name":"Trial by fire","name":"Trial by fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1216880/aaff6d22241093b6abb47e59f0000d2633f22acb.jpg"},{"icon":"2a6263d1632038c9c972cd28faef7612a85f2d80.jpg","localized_name":"Reconnaissance","name":"Reconnaissance","pa